TITLE Equilibrium simulation at 100C, pH 3 with multiple minerals - attempt 4

SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3
    pe 4
    units mol/L
    water 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica       0  10
    Kaolinite    0  10
    Dolomite     0  10
    Epsomite     0  10
    Fe(OH)3(a)   0  10
    Halite       0  10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file kaolinite_sim4.sel
    -reset false
    -equilibrium_phases K-mica Kaolinite Dolomite Epsomite Fe(OH)3(a) Halite
    -high_precision true

END
